{"content":[{"c":["PUBLIUS"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Name of a resident of the island of Malta, mentioned in ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.28.7-8","r":"Acts.28.7-8","rawR":"Acts.28.7-8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.28.7-8","value":"Acts.28.7-8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 28:7-8"},". He hosted Paul and others briefly after a shipwreck had stranded them on the island as they journeyed to Rome. Publius bore a title that indicated he was an important official on Malta at the time. His ailing father was healed by Paul during the visit."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Publius","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Acts 28:7-8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.28.7-8","rawQueryValue":"Acts.28.7-8","sourceRefExact":"Acts.28.7-8"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"52e0abb20abc7ea09384eaa946ec41d5cbf21d06b2df87e4f3eb7a64abf36b05","sourceItemName":"Publius","sourceItemOrder":306,"sourceMember":"Articles/P.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Publius","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Publius","title":"Publius","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}